{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45699","headline":"上荆南府主三让德政碑 · 贯休","name":"上荆南府主三让德政碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明明赫赫中兴主，动纳诸隍冠前古。\n四海英雄尽戢兵，皆如圪圪天金柱。\n万姓多论政与德，请树丰碑似山岳。\n一从寇灭二十年，琬琰雕镌赐重叠。\n荆州化风何卓异，寡欲无爲合天地。\n虽立贞碑与衆殊，字字皆是吾皇意。\n君侯捧碑西拜泣，臣且何人恩洊及。\n凤皇衔下雕龙文，德昧政虚争敢立。\n函封三奏心匍匐，坚让此碑声盖国。\n我恐江淹五色笔，作不立此碑之碑文不得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}